    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "David Ross Estate Agents your local property experts are delighted to present no.47 Muckross Avenue, Perrystown.\r\nNumber 47 Muckross Avenue presents a rare opportunity to acquire a home on one of Perrystown’s most established and sought-after residential roads. While requiring complete refurbishment and modernisation, the property offers exceptional potential for buyers to create a bespoke family home tailored to their own tastes and requirements. Set within a mature and well regarded neighbourhood.  Muckross Avenue is renowned for its strong sense of community, generous gardens, and convenient access to schools, parks, local amenities, and excellent transport links. This is an exciting opportunity to unlock the full potential of a property in a highly desirable Dublin location.\r\nOn the ground floor you are welcomed by a generous entrance hall off which you will find a large living room with a feature fireplace, family bathroom and a sunny kitchen with direct access to a large mature garden. The garden benefits further from rear laneway access.\r\nOn the first floor you will find a large sunny landing and three generously sized bedrooms with the largest also benefiting from views across the green.\r\nProviding an opportunity for purchasers to revive a once much loved home in a superb location No.47 provides a rare opportunity for families, first time buyers and investors alike to purchase in this much sought after location.  Early viewing is highly recommended.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures\r\nRenovation opportunity\r\nEligible for the vacant homes refurbishment grant\r\nSuperb location\r\nLarge front garden\r\nSouth westerly back garen\r\nRear laneway access"
      },
      {
